      "biography": {
        "value": "<h2>Description</h2><p>A white wall blocking passage with a hulking creature half way out of it. If one were to get by it, one must defeat it or perish.</p><h2>Defense</h2><p>AC 28, touch 8, flat-footed 28 (+20 natural, -2 size)</p><p>hp 231 [294] (14d10+154)</p><p>Fort +19, Ref +9, Will +10</p><p>DR 10/evil; Immune Bleed, Blind, Curse, Daze, Death Effects, Holy, Mind-affecting, Nauseating, Outsider traits, Paralyze, Petrification/Statue, Sickening, Static, Stun; Resist Lightning 10, Fire 10, Earth 25; SR 22;</p><h2>Offense</h2><p>Speed 40 ft.</p><p>Melee Bite +23 (2d6+11), 2 Claws +24 (2d8+11 19-20/x3)</p><p>Space 15 ft.; Reach 15 ft.</p><p>Special Attacks Shockwave</p><h2>Statistics</h2><p>Str 32, Dex 10, Con 30, Int 10, Wis 18, Cha 14</p><p>Base Atk +14; CMB +27; CMD 37</p><p>Feats Cleave, Improved Critical (Claw), Iron Will, Power Attack, Toughness, Vital Strike, Weapon Focus (Claw)</p><p>Skills Bluff +19, Intimidate +19, Knowledge (Local) +17, Knowledge (Planes) +17, Perception +21, Sense Motive +21</p><p>Languages Celestial</p><p>SQ Razor-sharp Claw</p>"
      }
